WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }
::cue(c.colora8c7fa) { color: #a8c7fa; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Premium</c></b>
Keep the project alive: <c.colora8c7fa>ko-fi.com/not6ip</c>

2
00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:14.530
Beyond the heavy rain is a rainbow
hageshii ame no mukou kakaru niji wo mita

3
00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:26.170
I'll know the easy answer's a lie
tayasui kotae wa uso dato shiru darou

4
00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:31.880
Vow not to back down to the shouting
dekai koe nanka ni makenai to chikatte

5
00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:35.630
I need you alone to understand tomorrow
anata hitori ni wakatte hoshii ashita

6
00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:40.770
You gave me the time of my life
yume no youna jikan kureta anata

7
00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:51.280
What do I look like? An ANGEL or a DEVIL...
watashi wa dou mieteruno? sorega tenshi ka akuma ka

8
00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:56.240
Beyond the dawn, beyond the dawn
yoake no mukou yoake no mukou

9
00:00:56.240 --> 00:01:01.740
There's so much I want to tell you
hanashitai koto takusan arun da

10
00:01:01.870 --> 00:01:06.540
Filled with love, with love
ai kometa ai kometa

11
00:01:06.670 --> 00:01:12.460
That can't be written down in a letter
tegami ni kakikirenai omoi da

12
00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:20.890
A small hand in search of eternity
eien wo sagashita chiisana tenohira

13
00:01:32.230 --> 00:01:38.780
<b>"Kuma's Past -
Better Off Dead in This World"</b>

14
00:01:53.460 --> 00:01:56.510
An Elder, St. Saturn, has made landfall!

15
00:01:56.630 --> 00:01:59.640
What?! When did he come ashore?!

16
00:01:59.760 --> 00:02:01.010
And how?!

17
00:02:01.140 --> 00:02:03.010
Everyone except vice admirals
and rear admirals,

18
00:02:03.470 --> 00:02:06.980
move away from the town center!

19
00:02:09.730 --> 00:02:12.650
You should refrain
from beholding his holy visage!

20
00:02:15.690 --> 00:02:17.570
What's really going on?!

21
00:02:17.990 --> 00:02:21.160
Even the admirals are at the beck and call of
just a single Celestial Dragon...

22
00:02:21.530 --> 00:02:23.490
An Elder stands above all those gods!

23
00:02:23.620 --> 00:02:25.540
Such a being...

24
00:02:25.580 --> 00:02:28.250
...came all the way here
from Mary Geoise?!

25
00:02:28.370 --> 00:02:31.420
I've only seen them in portraits!

26
00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:47.560
What are those streaks of lightning?!

27
00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:53.730
Bonney!

28
00:02:54.270 --> 00:02:56.030
What have you done?!

29
00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:02.570
St. Saturn!

30
00:03:02.620 --> 00:03:05.450
How dare you, Jewelry Bonney...

31
00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:07.410
You stabbed an Elder!

32
00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:10.500
That man stands atop the very world itself!

33
00:03:11.960 --> 00:03:14.540
Everyone! Aim your weapons!

34
00:03:20.170 --> 00:03:22.930
This is no good.

35
00:03:23.050 --> 00:03:25.890
Bonney! Get away from him!

36
00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:30.020
Because of you...!

37
00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:31.890
Silence, insects.

38
00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:34.360
If I didn't want to get stabbed...

39
00:03:35.190 --> 00:03:36.980
I would have avoided it!

40
00:03:44.780 --> 00:03:46.330
Bonney-chan!

41
00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:48.540
How dare you?!

42
00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:52.290
How foolish...

43
00:03:59.010 --> 00:04:00.050
Sanji!

44
00:04:03.300 --> 00:04:04.930
It is no use.

45
00:04:09.720 --> 00:04:11.680
What?! The blood vanished!

46
00:04:16.110 --> 00:04:19.110
Seize Vegapunk and the others now!

47
00:04:22.490 --> 00:04:24.950
Wait, you fools!

48
00:04:27.830 --> 00:04:30.910
No need to rush.
They have nowhere to run!

49
00:04:30.950 --> 00:04:32.080
Just ready your weapons!

50
00:04:32.210 --> 00:04:32.870
Yes, sir!

51
00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:34.580
Now...

52
00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:38.170
This kind of sluggish work isn't like you.

53
00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:39.380
Kizaru.

54
00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:43.630
I apologize... I can offer no excuse...

55
00:04:44.180 --> 00:04:45.890
Plus, I don't think...

56
00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:48.470
...I'll be able to move for a while.

57
00:04:56.690 --> 00:04:57.520
Let's see.

58
00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:02.070
Strong Right!

59
00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:13.200
I see... a pirate crew that cooperates.

60
00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:16.080
Even a man on top of the world...

61
00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:19.170
...wants our captain's head?!

62
00:05:22.510 --> 00:05:24.300
Straw Hat Luffy.

63
00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:26.470
Jewelry Bonney.

64
00:05:27.050 --> 00:05:31.310
We failed to anticipate
 your presence on the island.

65
00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:38.100
But if your fate is strong enough to
 escape this desperate situation...

66
00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:40.310
I would love to see it.

67
00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:42.860
And you, Vegapunk.

68
00:05:43.780 --> 00:05:46.400
It is a pity that you betrayed us.

69
00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:51.620
Thank you for your many contributions
to our military thus far.

70
00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:57.370
Who should die first? Name them in order of who you will most grieve.

71
00:06:00.880 --> 00:06:06.420
I want you to die with nothing but regret for
 your rebellion against the World Government.

72
00:06:19.940 --> 00:06:25.110
Why do humans always want to do
what is forbidden?

73
00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:31.740
Wait! Stop!

74
00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:42.420
This is strange!
Hey, can any of you move?!

75
00:06:42.540 --> 00:06:45.000
No, I want to but I can't!

76
00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:47.550
It's like I'm being held down!

77
00:06:49.380 --> 00:06:53.800
What's going on?!
Even with my strength, I can't move!

78
00:06:54.310 --> 00:06:58.020
If this isn't something scientific,
it must be a Devil Fruit power!

79
00:06:58.060 --> 00:06:59.480
Oh no! Bonney!

80
00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:02.770
You...

81
00:07:03.110 --> 00:07:04.940
...killed my father!

82
00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:06.690
Saturn!

83
00:07:07.820 --> 00:07:09.320
Kuma...

84
00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:12.910
He was born into a slave caste.

85
00:07:15.370 --> 00:07:19.910
The descendant of a clan that once
committed a grave crime against the world.

86
00:07:20.370 --> 00:07:24.290
The sole survivor of
the extinct Buccaneer People.

87
00:07:33.140 --> 00:07:33.760
Bonney.

88
00:07:36.060 --> 00:07:38.600
Ever since I was a child,

89
00:07:39.310 --> 00:07:45.480
I wanted to be a hero who could save
the downtrodden and suffering.

90
00:07:43.440 --> 00:07:45.770
"Justice"

91
00:07:45.900 --> 00:07:49.110
Just like Nika, the Warrior of Liberation.

92
00:07:49.690 --> 00:07:52.200
Everyone, get a good aim at her head!

93
00:08:12.970 --> 00:08:13.970
Bonney-chan!

94
00:08:14.470 --> 00:08:15.430
Leave her alone!

95
00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:18.260
Don't shoot! She's still a child!

96
00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:23.480
Then,

97
00:08:23.890 --> 00:08:26.980
will he come and free me, too?!

98
00:08:27.570 --> 00:08:28.980
Of course!

99
00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:37.200
<b>47 Years Ago, Sorbet
 Kingdom, South Blue</b>

100
00:08:37.660 --> 00:08:39.450
He's a big boy!

101
00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:41.160
Congratulations!

102
00:08:42.710 --> 00:08:44.620
Oh, good boy.

103
00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:48.000
Hi.

104
00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:50.210
I'm happy to see you.

105
00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:52.470
Thank you for being born, Kuma!

106
00:08:57.470 --> 00:08:58.260
Um...

107
00:08:59.060 --> 00:09:00.220
Doctor.

108
00:09:00.350 --> 00:09:02.180
Is this about his blood?

109
00:09:02.730 --> 00:09:04.390
Don't worry.

110
00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:06.520
I won't tell anyone.

111
00:09:07.350 --> 00:09:09.730
Th-Thank you!

112
00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:15.990
I'm back.

113
00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:18.120
Oh! Welcome home.

114
00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:23.580
All right. You're a good boy.

115
00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:24.620
Up you go!

116
00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:28.380
He's a cheerful boy!

117
00:09:48.650 --> 00:09:51.150
<b>Four Years
 After Kuma's Birth</b>

118
00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:00.490
Thank you for waiting.

119
00:10:00.530 --> 00:10:04.120
Kuma, let's clean up and eat!

120
00:10:05.790 --> 00:10:06.660
Okay!

121
00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:09.580
Someone gave us
freshly harvested potatoes today.

122
00:10:09.710 --> 00:10:11.590
I'll help you clean and cook!

123
00:10:15.670 --> 00:10:17.970
I'm sorry, Clapp! You need to run!

124
00:10:18.090 --> 00:10:20.050
What do you mean, Doctor?

125
00:10:20.180 --> 00:10:21.850
Run now!

126
00:10:22.180 --> 00:10:26.270
The Government's minions
came to the hospital!

127
00:10:28.730 --> 00:10:31.560
I'm sorry! I'm so sorry!

128
00:10:34.730 --> 00:10:36.570
You tried to help them escape.

129
00:10:37.570 --> 00:10:38.700
You quack...

130
00:10:38.820 --> 00:10:40.740
What do you people want?

131
00:10:41.160 --> 00:10:42.700
I think you know.

132
00:10:44.030 --> 00:10:45.330
You have to come with us.

133
00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:53.920
You put up quite a fight.

134
00:10:54.710 --> 00:10:55.800
Wait!

135
00:10:55.840 --> 00:10:58.510
I'm the only one who has Buccaneer blood!

136
00:10:58.550 --> 00:10:59.760
My wife doesn't!

137
00:11:01.090 --> 00:11:03.800
Let her and my boy go!

138
00:11:04.260 --> 00:11:05.680
Please!

139
00:11:05.720 --> 00:11:08.480
All you need is me, right?!

140
00:11:08.520 --> 00:11:09.640
Please...

141
00:11:09.690 --> 00:11:13.060
Please let my family go!

142
00:11:21.820 --> 00:11:22.780
Kuma...

143
00:11:23.740 --> 00:11:25.200
Don't worry.

144
00:11:25.700 --> 00:11:27.830
It's going to be all right...

145
00:11:40.670 --> 00:11:43.390
Kuma... Live your life.

146
00:11:44.430 --> 00:11:46.470
No matter how hard it gets.

147
00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:48.560
Mom!

148
00:11:51.390 --> 00:11:52.900
You must come this way.

149
00:11:54.400 --> 00:11:56.270
We'll see each other again.

150
00:11:56.320 --> 00:11:58.480
Stay strong, Kuma!

151
00:11:59.240 --> 00:12:00.820
Dad!

152
00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:16.380
Look! He's this young but this strong!

153
00:12:16.880 --> 00:12:19.420
He's a Buccaneer slave-eh.

154
00:12:24.260 --> 00:12:26.390
Hey! Hurry up-eh!

155
00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:29.100
Yes, sir!

156
00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:35.060
You irritate me-eh!
Why can't you move faster?!

157
00:12:35.190 --> 00:12:38.940
That hurts! I'm sorry!

158
00:12:55.120 --> 00:12:58.090
Stop crying! Or I'll kill you-eh!

159
00:13:09.220 --> 00:13:10.930
H-Hey, Kuma...

160
00:13:11.060 --> 00:13:13.350
What? Dad?

161
00:13:16.650 --> 00:13:18.020
You're hurt.

162
00:13:18.150 --> 00:13:22.070
Yeah, but it... it's nothing.

163
00:13:22.440 --> 00:13:24.150
You've grown so much.

164
00:13:24.570 --> 00:13:26.110
Are you doing okay?

165
00:13:27.070 --> 00:13:30.700
Yes! My master is very kind and gentle...

166
00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:33.200
So I'm very lucky.

167
00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:34.660
Good...

168
00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:36.170
Dad...

169
00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:39.540
How is Mom doing?

170
00:13:46.840 --> 00:13:49.140
Listen, Kuma...

171
00:13:50.470 --> 00:13:51.510
Your mother...

172
00:13:52.510 --> 00:13:54.430
Your mother's dead...

173
00:13:54.560 --> 00:13:55.520
What?

174
00:13:57.270 --> 00:13:59.900
She should be in heaven by now.

175
00:14:00.650 --> 00:14:02.070
I think...

176
00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:04.280
...she's better off that way.

177
00:14:17.460 --> 00:14:18.750
Hey, Kuma.

178
00:14:19.120 --> 00:14:20.710
You're strong.

179
00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:23.250
Endure! Endure and survive!

180
00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:27.090
Why? I think I'd be better off dead too...

181
00:14:27.510 --> 00:14:29.840
The Warrior of Liberation will come!

182
00:14:29.890 --> 00:14:31.930
He'll come to save you!

183
00:14:32.470 --> 00:14:33.510
Who is that?

184
00:14:34.140 --> 00:14:36.350
Nika, the Sun God!

185
00:14:36.430 --> 00:14:37.640
TA-DAH

186
00:14:38.060 --> 00:14:41.940
It's the name of a legendary warrior
that has been passed down...

187
00:14:41.980 --> 00:14:44.230
...in our Buccaneer heritage
for generations!

188
00:14:44.270 --> 00:14:47.400
One day, he'll come and take you out...

189
00:14:47.690 --> 00:14:50.820
...under the sun, to the freedom of the sea!

190
00:14:51.570 --> 00:14:52.370
Are you sure?

191
00:14:52.490 --> 00:14:54.950
Yes, I'm sure.

192
00:14:55.330 --> 00:14:57.410
Nika is always laughing!

193
00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:03.090
And he'll make people smile
with a rhythm like this.

194
00:15:17.980 --> 00:15:18.770
What?

195
00:15:19.390 --> 00:15:20.890
Shut up-eh!

196
00:15:30.450 --> 00:15:32.610
You've waited a long time!

197
00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:35.370
This is a triennial event
to test your skills!

198
00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:37.040
The Native-Hunting...

199
00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:39.620
<b>38 Years Ago,
 West Blue</b>

200
00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:39.620
...Competition!

201
00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:45.170
This year, it takes place...

202
00:15:45.170 --> 00:15:48.340
...on an island
unaffiliated with the World Government!

203
00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:50.590
God Valley!

204
00:15:53.430 --> 00:15:57.390
This island,
shamelessly named "God's Valley,"

205
00:15:57.390 --> 00:15:59.930
possesses rich natural resources.

206
00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:04.150
We'll hold a customary human hunt here,

207
00:16:04.150 --> 00:16:08.530
and claim this island
 for the World Government!

208
00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:12.450
How dare you?!

209
00:16:12.490 --> 00:16:15.240
Are you going to kill my people
for sport?!

210
00:16:15.280 --> 00:16:16.490
You're insane!

211
00:16:16.950 --> 00:16:19.240
This is our land!

212
00:16:19.370 --> 00:16:20.200
Your Majesty!

213
00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:23.620
What-eh? He is rude-eh!

214
00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:38.260
Your Majesty!

215
00:16:38.810 --> 00:16:40.100
Whoa-whoa!

216
00:16:40.220 --> 00:16:41.680
Wait a minute!

217
00:16:42.730 --> 00:16:43.980
St. Garling.

218
00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:45.730
No head starts!

219
00:16:45.850 --> 00:16:50.440
He's already taken down
the king of the natives!

220
00:16:53.860 --> 00:16:58.780
Top contender St. Garling will have to
start with negative 10,000 points!

221
00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:02.290
The handicap will make the competition
more interesting.

222
00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:04.160
<b>St. Figarland Garling,
 a Holy Knight</b>

223
00:17:05.710 --> 00:17:07.170
So cool!

224
00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:09.340
He lost a lot of points-eh.

225
00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:11.130
But that felt good-eh!

226
00:17:15.470 --> 00:17:17.140
As always,

227
00:17:17.180 --> 00:17:20.970
in addition to the native rabbits,
we have a wide selection of...

228
00:17:21.520 --> 00:17:24.940
...problematic slaves
and criminals to hunt!

229
00:17:25.980 --> 00:17:28.020
I can't believe this!

230
00:17:28.150 --> 00:17:29.610
He's a monster!

231
00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:31.690
A slave escaped!

232
00:17:31.730 --> 00:17:32.610
Wait...

233
00:17:32.990 --> 00:17:34.320
Huh? Hey!

234
00:17:34.360 --> 00:17:36.490
You guys were watching, weren't you?!

235
00:17:36.610 --> 00:17:38.570
I-I'm so sorry!

236
00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:42.120
Take responsibility and go get him!

237
00:18:06.730 --> 00:18:07.980
There he is!

238
00:18:14.320 --> 00:18:15.530
You fool!

239
00:18:15.650 --> 00:18:17.150
You can't escape!

240
00:18:17.280 --> 00:18:19.990
Stop messing around! Come with us!

241
00:18:20.120 --> 00:18:22.490
No! I don't want to!

242
00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:25.120
Shut up! Just come with us!

243
00:18:29.330 --> 00:18:31.540
No! Let go of me!

244
00:18:31.590 --> 00:18:34.090
Please! Let go of me!

245
00:18:34.670 --> 00:18:38.300
No! I don't ever wanna go back there!

246
00:18:38.430 --> 00:18:40.140
You little punk!

247
00:18:44.180 --> 00:18:46.060
Crying won't do any good!

248
00:18:46.180 --> 00:18:47.430
You shitty brat!

249
00:18:48.940 --> 00:18:51.360
No! I can't take it anymore...

250
00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:52.980
Stop resisting!

251
00:18:53.110 --> 00:18:54.020
Go back!

252
00:18:54.150 --> 00:18:55.900
- No!
- You little shit!

253
00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:57.490
- Screw that place!
- Hey!

254
00:18:57.990 --> 00:19:00.200
Why don't you kill me here?!

255
00:19:00.240 --> 00:19:01.530
Even if I go back...

256
00:19:01.570 --> 00:19:04.700
I will die anyway!

257
00:19:05.120 --> 00:19:07.160
Shut up!

258
00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:09.410
Sir!

259
00:19:09.750 --> 00:19:12.580
They caught the escaped child.

260
00:19:12.630 --> 00:19:14.000
It's the Buccaneer child.

261
00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:18.760
Gee...

262
00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:21.220
You can't just run away.

263
00:19:21.340 --> 00:19:23.760
We're a team of ten,
all responsible for each other.

264
00:19:24.260 --> 00:19:25.470
If you escape,

265
00:19:26.060 --> 00:19:28.560
we'll all get killed!

266
00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:30.890
Heehaw!

267
00:19:30.940 --> 00:19:33.770
Hey! Hold it right there!

268
00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:37.230
Are you the grand prize of this event?!

269
00:19:37.860 --> 00:19:39.740
The Buccaneer boy?!

270
00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:41.240
What?

271
00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:44.240
You sure are big!

272
00:19:44.780 --> 00:19:47.910
I heard you carry the blood of the Giants!

273
00:19:55.210 --> 00:19:57.800
My big bro's big too, right?!

274
00:19:57.920 --> 00:19:59.630
Only my face!

275
00:19:59.670 --> 00:20:02.510
Cut it out, you fool!

276
00:20:03.840 --> 00:20:08.520
Look at all those gloomy, miserable mugs!

277
00:20:08.560 --> 00:20:10.930
Are you guys enjoying life?!

278
00:20:11.060 --> 00:20:13.310
Shut up, you brat!

279
00:20:13.940 --> 00:20:15.730
Oh, you guys...

280
00:20:18.530 --> 00:20:21.320
Do you want to die?
Or do you want to live?

281
00:20:23.030 --> 00:20:25.240
Isn't that obvious?!

282
00:20:25.370 --> 00:20:27.450
But what can we do?

283
00:20:27.580 --> 00:20:29.790
Work a miracle!

284
00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:37.960
<b>Emporio Ivankov, 
a Slave</b>
<b>Ginny,
a Slave</b>

285
00:20:32.120 --> 00:20:36.210
If you follow us, we've got a great plan.

286
00:20:36.330 --> 00:20:37.960
I choose life!

287
00:20:38.500 --> 00:20:40.920
How about you guys?!

288
00:21:00.980 --> 00:21:06.280
I can't protect anyone again
mata daremo mamorenai no

289
00:21:06.280 --> 00:21:11.080
It's my fault that the voice is fading away
kiekakaru koe wa boku no sei

290
00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:13.370
I don't even have time to look down
utsumuku hima mo nai no

291
00:21:13.370 --> 00:21:15.960
Gravel marks on my palms
tenohira ni tsuku jari no ato

292
00:21:15.960 --> 00:21:19.340
Start moving again, my ship
mata ugokidase boku no fune yo

293
00:21:19.750 --> 00:21:24.840
Though I can't fly in the broad sky
hiroi sora wa tobenai kedo

294
00:21:24.840 --> 00:21:30.720
I can light up the deep sea
fukai umi wa teraseru kara

295
00:21:30.850 --> 00:21:31.680
We
bokura wa

296
00:21:31.770 --> 00:21:34.180
EVERYDAY owarenai
EVERYDAY, can't let this be the end

297
00:21:34.180 --> 00:21:36.810
EVERYDAY makerenai
EVERYDAY, can't be defeated

298
00:21:36.810 --> 00:21:40.570
We have something here to protect
mamoru mono ga koko niwa aru

299
00:21:40.610 --> 00:21:43.110
This may not be what I expected
yosou chigai kamo?

300
00:21:43.190 --> 00:21:45.820
But we can't stop now
tomarenai yo mou

301
00:21:45.900 --> 00:21:51.120
We go on, sharing loneliness
kodoku wo ima wakeai susumu

302
00:21:51.240 --> 00:21:53.870
Don't be afraid
ojikedukuna yo

303
00:21:53.950 --> 00:21:57.830
I'm not the same person I was that day
ano hi no boku to chigau kara

304
00:21:57.870 --> 00:22:01.290
No one can stand in my way
dare nimo jama dekinai yo

305
00:22:02.050 --> 00:22:02.920
Now, move aside
saa doite

306
00:22:02.960 --> 00:22:05.510
Conquer the world, believe in the future
sekai wo seishite mirai wo shinjite

307
00:22:05.630 --> 00:22:08.090
Count up the nights
ikutsu mono yoru kazoete

308
00:22:08.090 --> 00:22:10.800
What did you see? What did you learn?
nani wo mite nani wo shitte

309
00:22:10.800 --> 00:22:13.810
To realize what was important
taisetsu na koto ni kiduita no
